  "content_id": "16136172",
  "title": "LibertyX (Crypto ATMs) Transaction Issues",
  "description": "Why Was My LibertyX Transaction Declined?\nIf your LibertyX crypto ATM transaction was declined, it may be due to account verification, pay...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Why Was My LibertyX Transaction Declined?</b></p><p class=\"no-margin\">If your LibertyX crypto ATM transaction was declined, it may be due to account verification, payment method issues, or transaction limits. Here’s a quick breakdown of what might’ve gone wrong and how to fix it:</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Common Reasons</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Verification Incomplete:</b> ID or phone verification not completed</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Payment Issues:</b> Insufficient funds or declined debit card</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Transaction Limits:</b> Daily or monthly limits exceeded</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Security Review:</b> Transaction flagged as high-risk or suspicious</p></li></ol><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Recommended Actions</b></p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Complete all required verification in the LibertyX app</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Ensure your card has sufficient funds and is supported</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Review LibertyX account limits before retrying</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Check your email (and spam) for messages from LibertyX</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Retry the transaction once all issues are resolved</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Contact LibertyX Support using the chat bubble on this page: <a href=\"https://libertyx.zendesk.com/hc/en-us\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"intercom-content-link\">https://libertyx.zendesk.com/hc/en-us</a></p></li></ol>",
